{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:00.06]Lex Luger on the beat\n[00:02.60]It's Swerve WRLD, bitch\n[00:03.40]Swervo, what you on nigga?\n[00:07.26]G-G-Gas Team\n[00:11.14]Skrrt\n[00:12.36]Ha-ha\n[00:14.28]Uh\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD & G Herbo]\n[00:14.50]Uh (Yeah), he know (Yeah)\n[00:15.82]Ain't with the fighting at all (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:17.14]Gun on my hip, that's my cheat code (Yeah)\n[00:19.06]Two Percs, I'm nodding off (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:20.66]I'm in Dior having a ball (Ball)\n[00:22.28]Me and Swerv', we gon' ball (Ball)\n[00:23.96]So much money, can't spend it all (All)\n[00:25.70]Big ole .40 in my drawers (Drawers)\n[00:26.64]All my demons sinister, uh (Yeah)\n[00:27.86]Someone get a minister, uh (Yeah)\n[00:28.84]Blue pills to the face (Yeah)\n[00:29.80]Pour up the lean to finish it off (Yеah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:33.40]Feel like Lеnny Kravitz (Kravitz)\n[00:35.64]In some Gucci glasses (Glasses)\n[00:39.18]Goddamn, that boy stylish (Stylish)\n[00:41.56]Hollow points, that boy wildin' (Wildin', uh)\n[Verse 2: G Herbo & Juice WRLD]\n[00:42.62]All my young niggas grew up wildin', CJ kept it silent\n[00:44.68]So much money that's coming, keep piling (Uh)\n[00:46.54]Put 250 off in an island\n[00:48.16]Say he from the east side, pull his file then\n[00:49.90]Running everything past on the island\n[00:51.38]Niggas was violent, used to be a child then\n[00:53.10]Three hundred thousand, whips, no mileage (Err)\n[00:54.78]And I'm dripping all in sauce like Alton\n[00:57.18]You get money, dial in\n[00:58.40]Get money, don't worry about niggas, don't get too much money\n[01:00.60]You get money, smile then, you pussy\n[01:02.50]Fuck nigga and you must be hatin' on me\n[01:04.06]You say I'm broke, how I am?\n[01:05.32]This rap shit fuel too many ho niggas\n[01:07.12]Every day, I be ready to throw the towel in\n[01:08.78]Gorillas, wolves when we howling\n[01:10.40]Gotta feed 'em, they stomachs growling\n[01:12.20]On the hunt, you don't eat if you don't kill nothin'\n[01:13.90]Get yo' ass up, make a nigga proud then (Yeah)\n[Verse 3: Juice WRLD]\n[01:15.56]Uh, make me proud (Make me proud)\n[01:31.26]My niggas on the prowl (On the prowl)\n[01:40.52]Pull up in that Ghost (Ghost)\n[01:45.36]My crib look like a haunted house, uh (Haunted house)\n[01:55.26]Smoking loud (Loud)\n[02:01.06]Yo' weed don't make a sound (At all)\n[02:05.78]What, you got a seven? (A seven?)\n[02:09.08]I'm smokin' out the pound (Out the bitch)\n[02:13.56]Ayy, yo (Yo)\n[02:14.98]My niggas on the roll (On the roll)\n[02:17.64]If it's about the dough ('Bout the dough)\n[02:21.48]We gon' lose control, ayy (Lose control)\n[02:25.14]Oh, I had to let you know (Ayy, oh, let you know)\n[02:32.80]Load the choppa up (Load the choppa up)\n[02:54.42]Cock it back and let it go (Let it go)\n[02:59.00]I put a brick on my wrist, dancing\n[03:02.80]Clean ass nigga with some dirty Fanta (Uh-huh)\n[03:09.42]Feel like a dog in the Rick Owens (Uh-huh)\n[03:14.98]Your bitch did all of the clique, she going (Yeah)\n[03:23.92]Your bitch did all of the coke, it's snowing (Yeah)\n[03:30.48]Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, ya' know (Know)\n[03:35.36]Big money, CEO, business suit with a Draco (Oh)\n[Outro]\n[03:48.40]G-G-Gas Team","words":[[0.06,0.26,"Lex"],[0.34,1.44,"Luger"],[1.62,1.68,"on"],[1.78,1.86,"the"],[2.04,2.26,"beat"],[2.6,2.88,"It's"],[2.92,3.14,"Swerve"],[3.18,3.24,"WRLD,"],[3.28,3.36,"bitch"],[3.4,4.48,"Swervo,"],[4.54,5.16,"what"],[5.2,5.3,"you"],[5.4,5.5,"on"],[5.54,5.9,"nigga?"],[7.26,7.78,"G-G-Gas"],[7.86,8.02,"Team"],[11.14,12.06,"Skrrt"],[12.36,14.2,"Ha-ha"],[14.28,14.3,"Uh"],[14.5,14.52,"Uh"],[14.56,14.72,"(Yeah),"],[15.0,15.06,"he"],[15.2,15.42,"know"],[15.46,15.58,"(Yeah)"],[15.82,15.94,"Ain't"],[16.0,16.06,"with"],[16.1,16.14,"the"],[16.24,16.56,"fighting"],[16.64,16.66,"at"],[16.74,16.9,"all"],[16.94,17.0,"(Yeah,"],[17.04,17.1,"yeah)"],[17.14,17.2,"Gun"],[17.24,17.26,"on"],[17.34,17.42,"my"],[17.5,17.62,"hip,"],[18.0,18.12,"that's"],[18.2,18.32,"my"],[18.38,18.56,"cheat"],[18.6,18.